===Ask Clara about the trouble in the Robot Settlement{{subst:void|<!--201090501-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|You suddenly receive a message from Clara &mdash; the shy little girl seems to be asking you for help.<br />While you may admire how Clara is as cute in text as she is in person, do go to the robot settlement and get an understanding of the situation as she had requested.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Clara)
:'''Clara:''' The thief has stolen parts again? How am I going to track down this crook?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Clara, what's wrong?
:'''Clara:''' Oh, it's you!
:'''Clara:''' There have been a few unusual thefts in the dwelling over the past few days.
:'''Clara:''' The vagrants say that the parts they worked so hard to obtain have completely vanished. They're worried that there's a thief in the camp...
:'''Clara:''' Despite our investigations, no one has been able to track down the thief. What's even stranger is that the thief appears to be only interested in stealing parts, and doesn't care about other valuable items...
:'''Clara:''' The vagrants had no choice but to ask Mr. Svarog to look into it, but he still hasn't found anything... I investigated the matter myself, but I came up empty-handed...
:'''Clara:''' Jeez... I'm baffled. What a strange thief...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Don't worry. We can go over the clues together.
::'''Clara:''' Are you also here to look into this case, {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}? Perhaps if we work together we can uncover some clues that I missed...
::'''Clara:''' It's just... I haven't found enough clues yet. The thief is really tricky. They haven't left any traces in the dwelling...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Why don't we go back to the crime scene and start from there?
::'''Clara:''' Are you also here to look into this case, {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}? Perhaps if we work together we can uncover some clues that I missed...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Mmm! The smell of crime... How exciting!
::'''Clara:''' ...Th&mdash;That look on your face is a bit scary...
::'''Clara:''' But if you're willing to help look into this case, perhaps we can uncover some clues that I missed.
:'''Clara:''' Oh! I heard the vagrants on patrol last night ran across the thief again, but I haven't had time to look into it... Should we go ask them?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Witnesses' firsthand accounts are crucial.
::'''Clara:''' You sound so cool, {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}... You're like one of the characters from Mr. Svarog's movies. Aren't they called detectives?
::'''Clara:''' Seeing you so fired up has me excited, too. Now, let's get started.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Genius detective girl, move out!
::'''Clara:''' That sounds kinda weird...
::'''Clara:''' But actually... I think it's cool, too! Now, let's get started, {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}!
----

;(Talk to Little Robot)
:'''Little Robot:''' ...
:(Looks like it hasn't gone back to normal yet... I should come back later.)
{{Dialogue End}}

===Question the witness of the theft cases involving mechanical parts{{subst:void|<!--201090502-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|Based on what Clara said, there had been lots of recent thefts for mechanical parts in the robot settlement.<br />The (probable) scent of crime excites you &mdash; Go, genius detective Clara and her genius assistant! The witness for the most recent theft should be able to provide clues.}}
