===Follow Clara back to Svarog's base{{subst:void|<!--201090506-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=companion|location=Robot Settlement|update|Clara and you are surprised to find a strange little robot to be the culprit of the thefts.<br />As you subdued it, the robot kept begging you for forgiveness and didn't show any aggression.<br />This made Clara feel rather down. Return to the base with her and plan your next move.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Clara)
----
:'''Svarog:''' Initiating assessment of the robot's condition. Please wait, Clara.
:'''Clara:''' While Mr. Svarog is assessing this little fella, let's give it a quick checkup ourselves.
:'''Clara:''' Huh? This paint job and these custom parts. And the way the parts are attached... It's all quite strange.
:'''Clara:''' But one thing is for certain... This little fella is not under remote control. He's operating entirely of his own accord...
:'''Clara:''' Its design is, well, unique. I've never seen a robot with a design like this before.
:'''Clara:''' It really seems like something that was thrown together rather quickly. Its creator most likely didn't consider whether the system would function properly or not...
:'''Clara:''' Is it a failed robot pet creation that has been abandoned...?
:'''Clara:''' But if it's a pet... then why would it gather parts itself?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What is a "robot pet"?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I think I've heard the term "robot pet" before.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This place has a somewhat lax definition of pets...
:'''Clara:''' I've heard that some vagrants in the dwelling keep the little robots they find as pets.
:'''Clara:''' Some vagrants also make modifications to their pets, which they call... pet upgrades.
:'''Clara:''' Pets like that are pretty rare, but some of the folks who have them have formed a small community to share ideas. Some are interested in nurturing robots. Others... force them into battle.
:'''Clara:''' If my memory serves me right, the parts this little fella stole were originally designed for that kind of pet upgrade.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Battle each other!? That's awful!
::'''Clara:''' The vagrants... or, to be more accurate, the majority of people in the Underworld regard robots as nothing more than tools.
::'''Clara:''' But I disagree. Robots have their own thoughts and feelings...
::'''Clara:''' It's great that you understand what I'm saying...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That sounds pretty interesting.
::'''Clara:''' That's not the word I'd use.
::'''Clara:''' I guess most people only see robots as tools. I'll try not to hold it against you.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've learned some unusual things...
::'''Clara:''' *sigh*... This robot pet phenomenon really gets to me.
:'''Clara:''' Erm... I'm sorry, I just suddenly felt some strong emotions. Let's get back to work on repairing the small robot.
:'''Clara:''' This jack's placement is... odd. The chip is buried deep inside. If you don't look closely enough, you won't even find it...
:'''Svarog:''' Assessment of the robot's condition is complete. The shell damage is estimated to be 98.2%.
:'''Svarog:''' The assessment concludes that a total recovery is impossible. It is recommended that the robot's external shell be removed and replaced while keeping the outer circuitry and related transmission devices.
:'''Clara:''' You can always rely on Mr. Svarog to come up with a brilliant idea! So, I guess we'll have to go find a new robot shell to fix it, right?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where can we buy one?
::'''Clara:''' Hmm... I'm not sure if anyone sells this kind of thing, however...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'll go and strip them from the other robots!
::'''Clara:''' Please don't use violent methods to solve this issue. There are other options...
:'''Clara:''' There must be some robot shells lying around the machine graveyard. Everyone calls it a graveyard, but there are actually lots of useful parts buried there.
:'''Clara:''' I'm gonna return the parts to the vagrants first, then I'll check on the little fella. Can I trust you to find a shell in the machine graveyard, (Trailblazer)?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I'm an expert at scavenging...
::'''Clara:''' Really? You could have what it takes to be a prospector, {{MC|ж=big sister|м=big brother}}.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I can always go grab one from another robot if needed...
::'''Clara:''' Please, please don't say things like that. You'll upset me...
:'''Clara:''' Then I'll entrust this task to you, (Trailblazer).
:'''Clara:''' Look for Toby at the front entrance. His appearance is... crude, but he's the robot most familiar with the machine graveyard. Just follow Toby.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

